WEBVTT

00:09:59.636 --> 00:10:06.636
(Laughter and applause)

00:10:08.036 --> 00:10:10.516
So Ken's exuberant faith

00:10:10.556 --> 00:10:13.516
helped to make my longing a reality.

00:10:13.556 --> 00:10:16.876
But those dreams of peace he had had,

00:10:16.916 --> 00:10:19.436
you know, we're all
still waiting for those, right?

00:10:19.436 --> 00:10:20.956
Which is the way it often goes,

00:10:20.996 --> 00:10:24.156
the beautiful world just out of reach.

00:10:24.156 --> 00:10:26.836
But while we're waiting,

00:10:26.876 --> 00:10:29.996
our broken hearts
can also help to connect us.